Cynthia Erivo and Ariana Grande star as Elphaba Thropp and Glinda Upland, while Jonathan Bailey, Ethan
Slater, Bowen Yang, Peter Dinklage, Michelle Yeoh, and Jeff Goldblum appear in supporting roles.

15
01:26:47,142 --> 01:26:53,142
Set in the Land of Oz before the events of The Wonderful Wizard of Oz, the film explores the early relationship between
Elphaba, the future Wicked Witch of the West, and her schoolmate Galinda, who becomes Glinda the Good.

16
01:32:34,285 --> 01:32:40,285
Universal Pictures and Marc Platt, who both produced the stage
musical, announced the film adaptation in 2012.

17
01:38:21,428 --> 01:38:27,428
After a long development and multiple delays, partly due to the COVID-19
pandemic, Chu was hired to direct, with Erivo and Grande cast in 2021.

18
01:44:08,571 --> 01:44:14,571
The adaptation was split into two parts to avoid omitting
plot points and further develop the characters.

19
01:49:55,714 --> 01:50:01,714
Principal photography on both films began in England in December 2022, was interrupted in July
2023 by the 2023 SAG-AFTRA strike, and resumed and concluded in January 2024.

20
01:55:42,857 --> 01:55:48,857
Wicked premiered at the State Theatre in Sydney on November 3, 2024,
and was released in the United States on November 22.

21
02:01:30,000 --> 02:01:36,000
It was critically and commercially successful, grossing $758.8 million worldwide on a $150 million budget and becoming the
highest-grossing Oz film, the highest-grossing musical film adaptation, and the fifth-highest-grossing film of 2024.

22
02:07:17,142 --> 02:07:23,142
Several publications declared the film a pop culture phenomenon and
one of the best musical films of the 21st century.

23
02:13:04,285 --> 02:13:10,285
Among its various accolades, Wicked earned ten nominations at the 97th Academy Awards
(including Best Picture), winning Best Costume Design and Best Production Design.

24
02:18:51,428 --> 02:18:57,428
It also received three awards from the National Board of Review (including Best Film) and
was listed among the top ten films of 2024 by the American Film Institute.

25
02:24:38,571 --> 02:24:44,571
The sequel, Wicked: For Good, was released on November 21, 2025.

26
